  "title": "tap-sctpchunkstat: add finish routine",
  "description": "Add a finish function to the call of `register_tap_listener()` which\nfrees the memory allocated by the tap. This includes the tap data\nallocated upon registration, as well as the list of SCTP statistics\nelements.\n\nRegister the existing function `sctpstat_reset()` as the reset handler\nfor the tap, so it gets called as wireshark/tshark need it, rather than\njust once when the listener is created.\n\nPing #20432",
